      <title>特斯拉能源帝国再扩张：休斯顿超级工厂，是就业潮还是GWh产能引爆点？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251112-%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E8%83%BD%E6%BA%90%E5%B8%9D%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%8D%E6%89%A9%E5%BC%A0%E4%BC%91%E6%96%AF%E9%A1%BF%E8%B6%85%E7%BA%A7%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E6%98%AF%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%9A%E6%BD%AE%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AFgwh%E4%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E5%BC%95%E7%88%86%E7%82%B9/</link>
